IMAPAccount int-sys
Host imap.int-sys.ru
Port 993
User g.cherdakly
PassCmd "pass int-sys/credentials"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore int-sys-remote
Account int-sys

MaildirStore int-sys-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path ~/mail/int-sys/
INBOX ~/mail/int-sys/INBOX

Channel int-sys
Far :int-sys-remote:
Near :int-sys-local:
Patterns INBOX Drafts Sent Trash
SyncState *
Create Both
Expunge Both

